### 8. PRIVACY

Users may paste private conversations, so:

* Do not save pasted conversations by default.
* Process text only when the user requests analysis.
* Do not send pasted content to analytics services.
* Do not log conversation contents in server logs.
* Clearly explain when text is sent to the configured AI provider.
* Provide a Clear Conversation button that removes the pasted text and displayed results from the interface.
* Do not claim that content is never stored unless the actual backend and AI provider behavior supports that claim.

